{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03427","headline":"同李员外春闺 · 崔湜","name":"同李员外春闺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"落日啼连夜，孤灯坐彻明。\n卷帘双燕入，披幌百花惊。\n陇上寒应晚，闺中织未成。\n管弦愁不意，梳洗懒无情。\n去岁闻西伐，今年送北征。\n容颜离别尽，流恨满长城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔湜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03427.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03427","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}